    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "Delete the expect in gap_adjust. A skipped count that does not fit in i32 becomes i32::MAX. Subtract it with saturating_sub. Add each score_one result with saturating_add. Do not change the leftmost match rule. foo_bar still scores 45. fooBar still scores 38. Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip."
